# Keep private candidate data and generated application artifacts out of public repos.
candidate-profile.md
candidate-profile*.md
private/
output/
generated/
.local-sensitive-patterns

# Common resume artifacts
*Master Resume*
*Resume*.docx
*Resume*.pdf
*Resume*.md
*Cover Letter*.docx
*Cover Letter*.pdf
*Cover Letter*.md

# The shipped prompts are tool files, not anyone's resume. On case-insensitive
# systems (Windows, macOS) "*Resume*.md" would also match prompts/resume.md.
!prompts/*.md

# Render/conversion output
rendered-*/
tmp-render*/
lo-profile/
lo-convert/

# Local editor/system noise
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
*.tmp
*.bak
